{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Reality Core",
    "steam_appid": 3125500,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125500/extras/4bb694e693e242ad182d98bb21df4219.avif?t=1733953124\" width=640 height=128 /></span>High-intensity dungeon crawler that fuses chaos with extraction shooter. When your spaceship\u2019s Reality Drive malfunctions, Reality Shards scatter across strange and dangerous universes. Stranded, you must fight through bizarre worlds, battle fierce creatures, and gather the shards needed to repair your ship and find your way home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125500/extras/4f0aa1012a4dc206e29e138d054bd47d.avif?t=1733953124\" width=640 height=128 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each dungeon in Reality Core is procedurally generated, ensuring a unique and fresh experience every time you play. From eerie undead catacombs, haunted libraries and entire planets made of food, every dungeon is unique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125500/extras/3bee582752c2afb7b7713d87cefd26c0.avif?t=1733953124\" width=640 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter everything from relentless zombies to mystical eyeball-mages and even sentient pizza. These diverse creatures are determined to protect the coveted Reality Shards that have recently fallen into their dungeons, presenting a formidable obstacle to your quest. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125500/extras/bb7a068b46c4ceae0c0cfdadc146933c.avif?t=1733953124\" width=640 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as an intrepid interdimensional traveler, equipped with a vast arsenal of weapons, power-ups, and items. You must navigate and conquer the treacherous dungeons, overcoming each universe's challenges to ultimately return to your own reality. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125500/extras/e1f8447e8eea990bfc093ff747225d0c.avif?t=1733953124\" width=640 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At its core, Reality Core is a looter shooter, offering a staggering collection of  unique guns and items to collect. From standard firearms like shotguns, SMGs, and semi-automatic rifles to more unconventional and... imaginative weaponry. Unleash eggs from chickens, explosive needles from cacti, and  more as you battle your way through the multiverse.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an exhilarating adventure in Reality Core, where every dungeon, enemy, and weapon brings a new level of excitement and challenge. Will you gather enough Reality Shards to repair your ship and find your way back home? The multiverse awaits your courage and skill.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125500/extras/4bb694e693e242ad182d98bb21df4219.avif?t=1733953124\" width=640 height=128 /></span>High-intensity dungeon crawler that fuses chaos with extraction shooter. When your spaceship\u2019s Reality Drive malfunctions, Reality Shards scatter across strange and dangerous universes. Stranded, you must fight through bizarre worlds, battle fierce creatures, and gather the shards needed to repair your ship and find your way home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125500/extras/4f0aa1012a4dc206e29e138d054bd47d.avif?t=1733953124\" width=640 height=128 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each dungeon in Reality Core is procedurally generated, ensuring a unique and fresh experience every time you play. From eerie undead catacombs, haunted libraries and entire planets made of food, every dungeon is unique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125500/extras/3bee582752c2afb7b7713d87cefd26c0.avif?t=1733953124\" width=640 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter everything from relentless zombies to mystical eyeball-mages and even sentient pizza. These diverse creatures are determined to protect the coveted Reality Shards that have recently fallen into their dungeons, presenting a formidable obstacle to your quest. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125500/extras/bb7a068b46c4ceae0c0cfdadc146933c.avif?t=1733953124\" width=640 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as an intrepid interdimensional traveler, equipped with a vast arsenal of weapons, power-ups, and items. You must navigate and conquer the treacherous dungeons, overcoming each universe's challenges to ultimately return to your own reality. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125500/extras/e1f8447e8eea990bfc093ff747225d0c.avif?t=1733953124\" width=640 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At its core, Reality Core is a looter shooter, offering a staggering collection of  unique guns and items to collect. From standard firearms like shotguns, SMGs, and semi-automatic rifles to more unconventional and... imaginative weaponry. Unleash eggs from chickens, explosive needles from cacti, and  more as you battle your way through the multiverse.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an exhilarating adventure in Reality Core, where every dungeon, enemy, and weapon brings a new level of excitement and challenge. Will you gather enough Reality Shards to repair your ship and find your way back home? The multiverse awaits your courage and skill.</p>",
    "short_description": "Blast through chaotic dungeons and unleash powerful weapons as you journey through the multiverse in search of a way home. Dodge, loot, and survive against deadly foes, extracting hard-won treasures to repair your ship and make it back!",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
    "reviews": "\u201cThis feels like Gungeon meets Issac in the best way\u201d<br />\r\n10/10 \u2013 Quick<br />\r\n",
